# Walkthrough - Segment 2: SDV Panel and Analyzer

We have successfully implemented the infrastructure to visualize and analyze the **Suelo de Dignidad Vital (SDV)** of the Cohorte Cero.

## Changes Made

### 1. Backend: SDV Analyzer
- **[sdv_analyzer.py](file:///c:/Users/DARKM/Documents/maxocracia-cero/maxocracia-cero/app/sdv_analyzer.py)**: A new engine that translates qualitative data (human dimensions, urgency levels, and follow-up reports) into quantitative scores (0.0 to 1.0) for the 7 SDV dimensions.
- **[forms_bp.py](file:///c:/Users/DARKM/Documents/maxocracia-cero/maxocracia-cero/app/forms_bp.py)**: Added two new endpoints:
    - `GET /forms/sdv/participant/<id>`: Returns the individual score for a participant.
    - `GET /forms/sdv/community`: Returns the aggregate status of the community.

### 2. Frontend: UI & Dashboard
- **[SDVTermometer.tsx](file:///c:/Users/DARKM/Documents/maxocracia-cero/maxocracia-cero/frontend/app/components/ui/SDVTermometer.tsx)**: A high-fidelity component using **Framer Motion** and **Lucide Icons** to display the 7 bars of dignity. It uses color-coded feedback (Red, Amber, Green) based on compliance.
- **[page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/DARKM/Documents/maxocracia-cero/maxocracia-cero/frontend/app/admin/sdv/page.tsx)**: A new Admin Dashboard section that shows:
    - **Community Overview**: The average coverage across the entire cohorte.
    - **Critical Points**: Automatic detection of dimensions under 70% coverage.
    - **Participant List**: Individual thermometers for each participant with a search feature.
- **[layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/DARKM/Documents/maxocracia-cero/maxocracia-cero/frontend/app/admin/layout.tsx)**: Integrated the "Panel SDV" link into the admin sidebar.

## Verification Results

- **Frontend Build**: The Next.js production build was executed successfully, ensuring no syntax or type errors in the new components.
- **API Logic**: The `SDVAnalyzer` logic was verified to correctly aggregate participant data and handle different urgency levels.

## Visual Interface

The new SDV Panel features a glassmorphism design that fits the premium aesthetic of the project:

- **Green Bars**: Dignity guaranteed (>90%).
- **Amber Bars**: Warning/Vulnerability (70-89%).
- **Red/Orange Bars**: Critical violations or high risk (<70%).

